  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国最绝美的秋日古村落是哪一个吗？上集，咱们聊了指南村塔川赵兴洞寨大池村洪村这集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名绝美到什么程度。尤其是排在榜首的那座连绵的石头，雕楼依着万仞绝壁拔地而起。深秋漫山彩林与冰川雪峰在同第一个画面里同框绽放。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第五名，阿者柯村云南元阳从藏在哀牢山深处，是哈尼梯田核心区里的一座老村子。山有多高，田就有多高，从山脚一层一层盘上来，能数出几千级。哈尼人。在这片山里种了一千多年的稻子，二零一三年，这片梯田成了世界文化遗产，村里的房子是土墙，茅草顶，圆圆的屋顶，像一朵朵蘑菇趴在梯田中间到了秋天，稻谷黄了，几千级梯田一级一级全被染成金色。清晨，云海漫上来，把整座山都淹了。今天在云里时隐时现，这样的景象，不是谁设计出来的，是一代又一代人拿一辈子的汗水累出来的。您说这算不算大地写给人的一封情书？第四名，士林村，浙江余姚。他在四明山深处是一座靠古世数出名的浙东老村，全村有几百棵古市树最老的，据说有六百来年深秋一到，树叶落得差不多了，枝头却挂满了红彤彤的柿子一竖一竖像点的一盏盏红灯笼，青蛙十强、石板路，全被映的暖烘烘的村里人摘柿子晒柿饼、屋檐下，一串串挂的满满当当，日子过得又忙又踏实。世子在老话里还有个好彩头，叫事事如意。几百年了，老树年年挂果，村里的日子也跟着一年一年过下去。这样的秋天不惊艳，却一下子让人心里踏实了。您说这是不是最接地气的美？第三名，白哈巴村新疆阿勒泰走到祖国西北边陲的尽头。这处村落被誉为西北第一村一百多户图瓦人聚居的原始村落静静卧在阿尔泰山深处，被上万亩金黄的白桦林海温柔环抱，与邻国边境隔阂相望，图瓦人在这里世代以游牧为生，就地采伐阿尔泰。松木用粗立圆木垒砌出一件间尖顶木刻楞小木屋，千百年来与雪山长相厮守。九月深秋，白桦林一夜染尽纯金阿尔泰山初雪封顶。银白雪峰下，是一望无际的灿烂林海。清晨，木屋屋顶飘起淡蓝炊烟，牛羊慢悠悠穿过金黄草甸，那种辽阔与沉静，美的像一幅洗尽尘俗的旷远油画。您说这是不是最干净的一种美？第二名，黄陵，江西婺源，很多观众心中的秋日第一名，一定是这座名满天下的挂榜山村。他是徽派古村，整座村子贴的山坡盖儿层层叠叠，像是挂在山腰上的一幅画。山里缺平地，晒谷子摊不开，村里人就想了个办法晒到屋顶上去。每年深秋，家家户户把辣椒、玉米、稻谷、南瓜、菊花摆进，圆圆的竹扁搁在屋顶。窗台和晒架上红的、黄的、橙的在粉墙黛瓦之间铺开，背后是一山秋色。这个习俗有个专门的名字叫晒秋，晒了几百年。如今，他成了全中国人已想到秋天丰收，脑子里马上冒出来的那幅画。他不只是好看，更让人想起老家的屋顶，想起小时候的秋天。您说这样的美，谁心里没有一份？那第一名到底是哪儿？先别急，聊到这儿，我先唠几句心里话，盘完这九处留言区有个事特别一致。好多朋友说年轻时候忙，没空出门，好多退休有空了想去走走，可不知道先去哪儿去了。看什么高海拔的地方，太冷的地方，身子去不了，有没有不用跑那么远，也能看明明白的。还有带孙孙孙女的更愁。孩子问咱这村子为什么叫这个名字？老魏人，当初为什么把房子盖成，这样可自己也说不全。您看咱们这个年纪看景，不光是图个热闹，更想知道这些老村子是怎么来的。当初为什么选在这儿安家，可这些东东西在手机上划完就忘上网，查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，又看的眼睛疼。前阵子我翻到一本书，正好解决这个问题，叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，分成五块自然奇观，文明印记、烟火、人间秘境，寻踪，人间天堂。咱们今天聊的这些自然也都在里头，这些村子当初是怎么选？在这儿的房子为什么盖成？这样背后藏着什么讲究什么季节去最值去了，该看哪几处几分钟，一个地方讲的明明白白，图印的特别漂亮。一页翻开就是一幅画，我自己是这么用的，能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，看的就不只是一座座老房子，而是老房子背后的蒋究就暂时去不了的，就着图文慢慢看，也算去过了。摆在茶几上，孙辈来了，翻两页，长见识不说，写作文也正好用得上。老两口晚上翻番商量明年去哪儿，比刷手机舒坦多了，房子会旧积蓄会花完。可这些老祖宗留下来的文化根脉传几辈人都贬不了职，趁现在还能买到给自己，也给下一代备一份书。就在左下角的商品里，感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看，人暂时走不出去，咱先把大好河山装进屋里，好说回正题，第一名，四川丹巴甲居藏寨为什么是他？前面九个村子？美的是一树红叶，一池清水，一片梯田，可他美的是一整座山谷，贾居藏寨在大渡河谷的山坡上加戎藏族人，几百年来就这么住着房子，一座接着一座顺着山势从河谷往上落，红的、白的、黄的强色一层压着一层，一直扑到雪山脚下，房子都是石头垒的三层楼，底层养生寇中间住人顶上晒粮食，供神屋顶四个角各供着一块白石头。丹巴还有个名号叫千雕之国，山谷里至今立着不少骨雕像，是替这片山谷站岗的老人。到了深秋，推开院门，脚下是深谷谷底的果树，黄了，山腰的树林红了。再往上是终年不化的雪峰，抬头是秋天，再抬头还是秋天，最后一抬头已经是冬天了。可面比的是哪一片秋色更好看。可它比的是，一座村子，能不能把山和树房子白雪四季全装进同一面山坡里修，他的人只想有个家。可几百年后，这个家把秋天盖成了一座立着的城十座古村落。讲完了指南，村把银杏和枫叶铺满了石板路，塔川把整座山染成了调色盘。赵兴洞寨的道浪涌到了古楼脚下，太行山大渠村的红饰挂上了石崖洪村，把秋天养进了一池水里，把这棵把梯田铺了几千级。士林村的老树点起了红灯笼，白哈巴的白桦林，守着国境线上的雪峰黄岭，把丰收晒在了屋顶上，可只有贾居藏寨，而山和树房子和雪落成了一座立起来的村子。原来最绝美的秋天不是一片叶子红了，而是整座山一起入了秋。最后问问你们，您这十个古村落，您去过几个最想去的是哪一个？评论区告诉我刚才说的那本大美中国左下方商品的就有爱看大好河山的朋友别错过，觉得这期让您长了见识，就转给身边跟您一样。爱看山河古村的人，想看懂更多中国传统民居和地理人文的绝美秘密，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 350,
      "end_ms": 4530,
      "text": "您知道中国最绝美的秋日古村落是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5350,
      "end_ms": 5970,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5990,
      "end_ms": 14230,
      "text": "咱们聊了指南村塔川赵兴洞寨大池村洪村这集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 14530,
      "end_ms": 16970,
      "text": "看看前五名绝美到什么程度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 17330,
      "end_ms": 21910,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座连绵的石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 21910,
      "end_ms": 25470,
      "text": "雕楼依着万仞绝壁拔地而起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 25950,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "深秋漫山彩林与冰川雪峰在同第一个画面里同框绽放。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 32640,
      "end_ms": 33400,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 33800,
      "end_ms": 35200,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 35600,
      "end_ms": 38000,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 38360,
      "end_ms": 39500,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 39860,
      "end_ms": 40520,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40940,
      "end_ms": 46440,
      "text": "阿者柯村云南元阳从藏在哀牢山深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 47140,
      "end_ms": 50700,
      "text": "是哈尼梯田核心区里的一座老村子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 51100,
      "end_ms": 52080,
      "text": "山有多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 52620,
      "end_ms": 53680,
      "text": "田就有多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 54360,
      "end_ms": 56560,
      "text": "从山脚一层一层盘上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 56820,
      "end_ms": 58180,
      "text": "能数出几千级。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 58840,
      "end_ms": 59500,
      "text": "哈尼人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 59500,
      "end_ms": 62585,
      "text": "在这片山里种了一千多年的稻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 63310,
      "end_ms": 64385,
      "text": "二零一三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64860,
      "end_ms": 67975,
      "text": "这片梯田成了世界文化遗产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 68370,
      "end_ms": 70035,
      "text": "村里的房子是土墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70630,
      "end_ms": 71415,
      "text": "茅草顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 72050,
      "end_ms": 73055,
      "text": "圆圆的屋顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 73600,
      "end_ms": 77975,
      "text": "像一朵朵蘑菇趴在梯田中间到了秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 78370,
      "end_ms": 79225,
      "text": "稻谷黄了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79700,
      "end_ms": 83335,
      "text": "几千级梯田一级一级全被染成金色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 84100,
      "end_ms": 84600,
      "text": "清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 84600,
      "end_ms": 85885,
      "text": "云海漫上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 86210,
      "end_ms": 87590,
      "text": "把整座山都淹了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88140,
      "end_ms": 90205,
      "text": "今天在云里时隐时现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90720,
      "end_ms": 91925,
      "text": "这样的景象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92350,
      "end_ms": 93895,
      "text": "不是谁设计出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 94260,
      "end_ms": 98355,
      "text": "是一代又一代人拿一辈子的汗水累出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 98800,
      "end_ms": 102765,
      "text": "您说这算不算大地写给人的一封情书？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 103200,
      "end_ms": 104045,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 104700,
      "end_ms": 105745,
      "text": "士林村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 106330,
      "end_ms": 107435,
      "text": "浙江余姚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 108220,
      "end_ms": 114515,
      "text": "他在四明山深处是一座靠古世数出名的浙东老村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 115390,
      "end_ms": 119025,
      "text": "全村有几百棵古市树最老的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 119350,
      "end_ms": 122135,
      "text": "据说有六百来年深秋一到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 122550,
      "end_ms": 124225,
      "text": "树叶落得差不多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124780,
      "end_ms": 132005,
      "text": "枝头却挂满了红彤彤的柿子一竖一竖像点的一盏盏红灯笼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 132880,
      "end_ms": 135705,
      "text": "青蛙十强、石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 136090,
      "end_ms": 142570,
      "text": "全被映的暖烘烘的村里人摘柿子晒柿饼、屋檐下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 142590,
      "end_ms": 144665,
      "text": "一串串挂的满满当当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 145160,
      "end_ms": 147435,
      "text": "日子过得又忙又踏实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 148090,
      "end_ms": 150575,
      "text": "世子在老话里还有个好彩头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 150970,
      "end_ms": 152475,
      "text": "叫事事如意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 152860,
      "end_ms": 153715,
      "text": "几百年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 154320,
      "end_ms": 155865,
      "text": "老树年年挂果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 156360,
      "end_ms": 159625,
      "text": "村里的日子也跟着一年一年过下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 160230,
      "end_ms": 161910,
      "text": "这样的秋天不惊艳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 162250,
      "end_ms": 164685,
      "text": "却一下子让人心里踏实了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 165350,
      "end_ms": 167945,
      "text": "您说这是不是最接地气的美？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 168360,
      "end_ms": 169100,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 169400,
      "end_ms": 175045,
      "text": "白哈巴村新疆阿勒泰走到祖国西北边陲的尽头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 175580,
      "end_ms": 184285,
      "text": "这处村落被誉为西北第一村一百多户图瓦人聚居的原始村落静静卧在阿尔泰山深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 184770,
      "end_ms": 188415,
      "text": "被上万亩金黄的白桦林海温柔环抱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 188760,
      "end_ms": 191085,
      "text": "与邻国边境隔阂相望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 191570,
      "end_ms": 193905,
      "text": "图瓦人在这里世代以游牧为生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 194330,
      "end_ms": 195770,
      "text": "就地采伐阿尔泰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 195770,
      "end_ms": 201845,
      "text": "松木用粗立圆木垒砌出一件间尖顶木刻楞小木屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 202450,
      "end_ms": 205355,
      "text": "千百年来与雪山长相厮守。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 205790,
      "end_ms": 206745,
      "text": "九月深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 207130,
      "end_ms": 211925,
      "text": "白桦林一夜染尽纯金阿尔泰山初雪封顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 212690,
      "end_ms": 213790,
      "text": "银白雪峰下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 213990,
      "end_ms": 216385,
      "text": "是一望无际的灿烂林海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 216890,
      "end_ms": 217370,
      "text": "清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 217490,
      "end_ms": 220065,
      "text": "木屋屋顶飘起淡蓝炊烟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 220680,
      "end_ms": 223545,
      "text": "牛羊慢悠悠穿过金黄草甸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 224040,
      "end_ms": 225975,
      "text": "那种辽阔与沉静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 226450,
      "end_ms": 230225,
      "text": "美的像一幅洗尽尘俗的旷远油画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 230850,
      "end_ms": 233965,
      "text": "您说这是不是最干净的一种美？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 234330,
      "end_ms": 235025,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 235500,
      "end_ms": 236075,
      "text": "黄陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 236560,
      "end_ms": 237685,
      "text": "江西婺源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 238490,
      "end_ms": 241505,
      "text": "很多观众心中的秋日第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 242090,
      "end_ms": 245465,
      "text": "一定是这座名满天下的挂榜山村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 245990,
      "end_ms": 247765,
      "text": "他是徽派古村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 248360,
      "end_ms": 251715,
      "text": "整座村子贴的山坡盖儿层层叠叠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 252120,
      "end_ms": 254345,
      "text": "像是挂在山腰上的一幅画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 254900,
      "end_ms": 256175,
      "text": "山里缺平地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 256620,
      "end_ms": 258095,
      "text": "晒谷子摊不开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 258480,
      "end_ms": 261965,
      "text": "村里人就想了个办法晒到屋顶上去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 262360,
      "end_ms": 263305,
      "text": "每年深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 263770,
      "end_ms": 268760,
      "text": "家家户户把辣椒、玉米、稻谷、南瓜、菊花摆进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 268880,
      "end_ms": 271200,
      "text": "圆圆的竹扁搁在屋顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 271440,
      "end_ms": 277600,
      "text": "窗台和晒架上红的、黄的、橙的在粉墙黛瓦之间铺开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 277900,
      "end_ms": 280065,
      "text": "背后是一山秋色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 280510,
      "end_ms": 283795,
      "text": "这个习俗有个专门的名字叫晒秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 284740,
      "end_ms": 285925,
      "text": "晒了几百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 286440,
      "end_ms": 287035,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 287460,
      "end_ms": 290905,
      "text": "他成了全中国人已想到秋天丰收，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 291500,
      "end_ms": 294065,
      "text": "脑子里马上冒出来的那幅画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 294530,
      "end_ms": 295675,
      "text": "他不只是好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 296450,
      "end_ms": 298485,
      "text": "更让人想起老家的屋顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 299200,
      "end_ms": 300935,
      "text": "想起小时候的秋天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 301590,
      "end_ms": 303430,
      "text": "您说这样的美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 303890,
      "end_ms": 305350,
      "text": "谁心里没有一份？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 305750,
      "end_ms": 307630,
      "text": "那第一名到底是哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 307910,
      "end_ms": 308590,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 308970,
      "end_ms": 309770,
      "text": "聊到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 309950,
      "end_ms": 311630,
      "text": "我先唠几句心里话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 312110,
      "end_ms": 316110,
      "text": "盘完这九处留言区有个事特别一致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 316730,
      "end_ms": 318510,
      "text": "好多朋友说年轻时候忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 318870,
      "end_ms": 319890,
      "text": "没空出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 320630,
      "end_ms": 323710,
      "text": "好多退休有空了想去走走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 324270,
      "end_ms": 326410,
      "text": "可不知道先去哪儿去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 326410,
      "end_ms": 328870,
      "text": "看什么高海拔的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 329330,
      "end_ms": 330370,
      "text": "太冷的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00113",
      "start_ms": 330730,
      "end_ms": 332060,
      "text": "身子去不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00114",
      "start_ms": 332440,
      "end_ms": 334340,
      "text": "有没有不用跑那么远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00115",
      "start_ms": 334720,
      "end_ms": 336620,
      "text": "也能看明明白的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00116",
      "start_ms": 336620,
      "end_ms": 339740,
      "text": "还有带孙孙孙女的更愁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00117",
      "start_ms": 339740,
      "end_ms": 344060,
      "text": "孩子问咱这村子为什么叫这个名字？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00118",
      "start_ms": 344060,
      "end_ms": 344660,
      "text": "老魏人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00119",
      "start_ms": 344660,
      "end_ms": 346640,
      "text": "当初为什么把房子盖成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00120",
      "start_ms": 346640,
      "end_ms": 350000,
      "text": "这样可自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00121",
      "start_ms": 350000,
      "end_ms": 352300,
      "text": "您看咱们这个年纪看景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00122",
      "start_ms": 352380,
      "end_ms": 353800,
      "text": "不光是图个热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00123",
      "start_ms": 354220,
      "end_ms": 357280,
      "text": "更想知道这些老村子是怎么来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00124",
      "start_ms": 357880,
      "end_ms": 360080,
      "text": "当初为什么选在这儿安家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00125",
      "start_ms": 360460,
      "end_ms": 364430,
      "text": "可这些东东西在手机上划完就忘上网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00126",
      "start_ms": 364450,
      "end_ms": 367250,
      "text": "查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00127",
      "start_ms": 367430,
      "end_ms": 368855,
      "text": "又看的眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00128",
      "start_ms": 369200,
      "end_ms": 371125,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00129",
      "start_ms": 371800,
      "end_ms": 373215,
      "text": "正好解决这个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00130",
      "start_ms": 373720,
      "end_ms": 378485,
      "text": "叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00131",
      "start_ms": 378940,
      "end_ms": 383335,
      "text": "他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00132",
      "start_ms": 383840,
      "end_ms": 386615,
      "text": "分成五块自然奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00133",
      "start_ms": 387060,
      "end_ms": 390510,
      "text": "文明印记、烟火、人间秘境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00134",
      "start_ms": 390510,
      "end_ms": 391125,
      "text": "寻踪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00135",
      "start_ms": 391520,
      "end_ms": 392485,
      "text": "人间天堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00136",
      "start_ms": 392880,
      "end_ms": 395735,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这些自然也都在里头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00137",
      "start_ms": 396230,
      "end_ms": 398250,
      "text": "这些村子当初是怎么选？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00138",
      "start_ms": 398250,
      "end_ms": 400810,
      "text": "在这儿的房子为什么盖成？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00139",
      "start_ms": 400810,
      "end_ms": 407040,
      "text": "这样背后藏着什么讲究什么季节去最值去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00140",
      "start_ms": 407040,
      "end_ms": 409530,
      "text": "该看哪几处几分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00141",
      "start_ms": 409530,
      "end_ms": 411515,
      "text": "一个地方讲的明明白白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00142",
      "start_ms": 411910,
      "end_ms": 413305,
      "text": "图印的特别漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00143",
      "start_ms": 413970,
      "end_ms": 416165,
      "text": "一页翻开就是一幅画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00144",
      "start_ms": 416600,
      "end_ms": 417985,
      "text": "我自己是这么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00145",
      "start_ms": 418290,
      "end_ms": 421380,
      "text": "能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00146",
      "start_ms": 421380,
      "end_ms": 422155,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00147",
      "start_ms": 422660,
      "end_ms": 425235,
      "text": "看的就不只是一座座老房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00148",
      "start_ms": 425540,
      "end_ms": 429685,
      "text": "而是老房子背后的蒋究就暂时去不了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00149",
      "start_ms": 429960,
      "end_ms": 431140,
      "text": "就着图文慢慢看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00150",
      "start_ms": 431440,
      "end_ms": 432465,
      "text": "也算去过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00151",
      "start_ms": 433090,
      "end_ms": 434215,
      "text": "摆在茶几上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00152",
      "start_ms": 434670,
      "end_ms": 435490,
      "text": "孙辈来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00153",
      "start_ms": 435490,
      "end_ms": 436245,
      "text": "翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00154",
      "start_ms": 436630,
      "end_ms": 437650,
      "text": "长见识不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00155",
      "start_ms": 438070,
      "end_ms": 440245,
      "text": "写作文也正好用得上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00156",
      "start_ms": 440720,
      "end_ms": 444435,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻番商量明年去哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00157",
      "start_ms": 444830,
      "end_ms": 446795,
      "text": "比刷手机舒坦多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00158",
      "start_ms": 447450,
      "end_ms": 449985,
      "text": "房子会旧积蓄会花完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00159",
      "start_ms": 450720,
      "end_ms": 456755,
      "text": "可这些老祖宗留下来的文化根脉传几辈人都贬不了职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00160",
      "start_ms": 457240,
      "end_ms": 459740,
      "text": "趁现在还能买到给自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00161",
      "start_ms": 459800,
      "end_ms": 462380,
      "text": "也给下一代备一份书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00162",
      "start_ms": 462780,
      "end_ms": 464825,
      "text": "就在左下角的商品里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00163",
      "start_ms": 465650,
      "end_ms": 467865,
      "text": "感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00164",
      "start_ms": 468340,
      "end_ms": 469675,
      "text": "人暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00165",
      "start_ms": 470160,
      "end_ms": 472335,
      "text": "咱先把大好河山装进屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00166",
      "start_ms": 472760,
      "end_ms": 474415,
      "text": "好说回正题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00167",
      "start_ms": 475170,
      "end_ms": 475835,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00168",
      "start_ms": 476230,
      "end_ms": 479675,
      "text": "四川丹巴甲居藏寨为什么是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00169",
      "start_ms": 480490,
      "end_ms": 481885,
      "text": "前面九个村子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00170",
      "start_ms": 482220,
      "end_ms": 483845,
      "text": "美的是一树红叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00171",
      "start_ms": 484220,
      "end_ms": 485195,
      "text": "一池清水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00172",
      "start_ms": 485530,
      "end_ms": 486675,
      "text": "一片梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00173",
      "start_ms": 487230,
      "end_ms": 489465,
      "text": "可他美的是一整座山谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00174",
      "start_ms": 490200,
      "end_ms": 495785,
      "text": "贾居藏寨在大渡河谷的山坡上加戎藏族人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00175",
      "start_ms": 496140,
      "end_ms": 499530,
      "text": "几百年来就这么住着房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00176",
      "start_ms": 499670,
      "end_ms": 504275,
      "text": "一座接着一座顺着山势从河谷往上落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00177",
      "start_ms": 504740,
      "end_ms": 509495,
      "text": "红的、白的、黄的强色一层压着一层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00178",
      "start_ms": 509930,
      "end_ms": 511495,
      "text": "一直扑到雪山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00179",
      "start_ms": 512150,
      "end_ms": 514775,
      "text": "房子都是石头垒的三层楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00180",
      "start_ms": 515280,
      "end_ms": 519295,
      "text": "底层养生寇中间住人顶上晒粮食，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00181",
      "start_ms": 519620,
      "end_ms": 523725,
      "text": "供神屋顶四个角各供着一块白石头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00182",
      "start_ms": 524150,
      "end_ms": 526965,
      "text": "丹巴还有个名号叫千雕之国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00183",
      "start_ms": 527740,
      "end_ms": 531220,
      "text": "山谷里至今立着不少骨雕像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00184",
      "start_ms": 531280,
      "end_ms": 533735,
      "text": "是替这片山谷站岗的老人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00185",
      "start_ms": 534290,
      "end_ms": 535195,
      "text": "到了深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00186",
      "start_ms": 535570,
      "end_ms": 536575,
      "text": "推开院门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00187",
      "start_ms": 537190,
      "end_ms": 540290,
      "text": "脚下是深谷谷底的果树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00188",
      "start_ms": 540370,
      "end_ms": 540925,
      "text": "黄了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00189",
      "start_ms": 541420,
      "end_ms": 543060,
      "text": "山腰的树林红了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00190",
      "start_ms": 543480,
      "end_ms": 546520,
      "text": "再往上是终年不化的雪峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00191",
      "start_ms": 547180,
      "end_ms": 548440,
      "text": "抬头是秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00192",
      "start_ms": 549100,
      "end_ms": 550720,
      "text": "再抬头还是秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00193",
      "start_ms": 551280,
      "end_ms": 554200,
      "text": "最后一抬头已经是冬天了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00194",
      "start_ms": 554800,
      "end_ms": 557420,
      "text": "可面比的是哪一片秋色更好看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00195",
      "start_ms": 557900,
      "end_ms": 558980,
      "text": "可它比的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00196",
      "start_ms": 559320,
      "end_ms": 560420,
      "text": "一座村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00197",
      "start_ms": 560740,
      "end_ms": 570280,
      "text": "能不能把山和树房子白雪四季全装进同一面山坡里修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00198",
      "start_ms": 570380,
      "end_ms": 572050,
      "text": "他的人只想有个家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00199",
      "start_ms": 572790,
      "end_ms": 573950,
      "text": "可几百年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00200",
      "start_ms": 574430,
      "end_ms": 579810,
      "text": "这个家把秋天盖成了一座立着的城十座古村落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00201",
      "start_ms": 579830,
      "end_ms": 581310,
      "text": "讲完了指南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00202",
      "start_ms": 581310,
      "end_ms": 584490,
      "text": "村把银杏和枫叶铺满了石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00203",
      "start_ms": 584950,
      "end_ms": 588070,
      "text": "塔川把整座山染成了调色盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00204",
      "start_ms": 588690,
      "end_ms": 592090,
      "text": "赵兴洞寨的道浪涌到了古楼脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00205",
      "start_ms": 592590,
      "end_ms": 597350,
      "text": "太行山大渠村的红饰挂上了石崖洪村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00206",
      "start_ms": 597390,
      "end_ms": 600110,
      "text": "把秋天养进了一池水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00207",
      "start_ms": 600470,
      "end_ms": 603805,
      "text": "把这棵把梯田铺了几千级。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00208",
      "start_ms": 604390,
      "end_ms": 607110,
      "text": "士林村的老树点起了红灯笼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00209",
      "start_ms": 607570,
      "end_ms": 609090,
      "text": "白哈巴的白桦林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00210",
      "start_ms": 609510,
      "end_ms": 612430,
      "text": "守着国境线上的雪峰黄岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00211",
      "start_ms": 612610,
      "end_ms": 614650,
      "text": "把丰收晒在了屋顶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00212",
      "start_ms": 615370,
      "end_ms": 617470,
      "text": "可只有贾居藏寨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00213",
      "start_ms": 618090,
      "end_ms": 624650,
      "text": "而山和树房子和雪落成了一座立起来的村子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00214",
      "start_ms": 625410,
      "end_ms": 629610,
      "text": "原来最绝美的秋天不是一片叶子红了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00215",
      "start_ms": 629810,
      "end_ms": 632850,
      "text": "而是整座山一起入了秋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00216",
      "start_ms": 633290,
      "end_ms": 634200,
      "text": "最后问问你们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00217",
      "start_ms": 634260,
      "end_ms": 636280,
      "text": "您这十个古村落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00218",
      "start_ms": 636620,
      "end_ms": 640180,
      "text": "您去过几个最想去的是哪一个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00219",
      "start_ms": 640500,
      "end_ms": 649280,
      "text": "评论区告诉我刚才说的那本大美中国左下方商品的就有爱看大好河山的朋友别错过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00220",
      "start_ms": 649760,
      "end_ms": 651660,
      "text": "觉得这期让您长了见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00221",
      "start_ms": 652020,
      "end_ms": 653900,
      "text": "就转给身边跟您一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00222",
      "start_ms": 653900,
      "end_ms": 655440,
      "text": "爱看山河古村的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00223",
      "start_ms": 655800,
      "end_ms": 661180,
      "text": "想看懂更多中国传统民居和地理人文的绝美秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00224",
      "start_ms": 661420,
      "end_ms": 662200,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b0c1a76023be08b1_s00225",
      "start_ms": 662500,
      "end_ms": 664085,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
